        "Learniq's personal-data processing activities are recorded in OpenRegister's platform processing-activity register. The Art. 30 register, per-access logging, exports, and access control are provided by OpenRegister; Learniq contributes its activity catalogue and surfaces it here. Access is restricted to administrators and the privacy officer (FG); non-privileged users are denied by OpenRegister.": "Learniq's personal-data processing activities are recorded in OpenRegister's platform processing-activity register. The Art. 30 register, per-access logging, exports, and access control are provided by OpenRegister; Learniq contributes its activity catalogue and surfaces it here. Access is restricted to administrators and the privacy officer (FG); non-privileged users are denied by OpenRegister.",
