        "DLE": "DLE",
        "Didactische leeftijd (DLE), when the provider or a derived calculation supplies it. Input for the DLE/leerrendement report scales (trend-and-export-reporting).": "Didactische leeftijd (DLE), when the provider or a derived calculation supplies it. Input for the DLE/leerrendement report scales (trend-and-export-reporting).",
        "Nextcloud user ID of the learner this result belongs to.": "Nextcloud user ID of the learner this result belongs to.",
        "UUID of the matching in-app AssessmentResult, when the school also ran the same toets as an Assessment. Null in the common case where the LVS toets has no learniq-side counterpart.": "UUID of the matching in-app AssessmentResult, when the school also ran the same toets as an Assessment. Null in the common case where the LVS toets has no learniq-side counterpart.",
        "UUID of the DataExchangeJob (target: lvs-results) that imported this result.": "UUID of the DataExchangeJob (target: lvs-results) that imported this result.",
        "Named OpenConnector connection (e.g. 'bron-rod', 'oso', 'leerplicht', 'surfconext', 'hr', 'swv', 'ooapi-catalog', 'timetable-import', 'lvs-results'). 'swv' routes a zorgvraag/TLV-chain dossier (learning-plan's SupportRequest) to the regional samenwerkingsverband (openconnector#753). 'ooapi-catalog' syncs a published/archived Course, Programme, or Cohort to the OOAPI 5.0 course catalog hosted by opencatalogi, per the course-management publication contract (course → course, program → program, offering → offering; see openspec/changes/delegate-ooapi-to-opencatalogi/design.md). 'timetable-import' (direction:import) hands a generated-timetable pull to the OpenConnector Zermelo/Untis/Xedule source configuration; TimetableImportHandler resolves the response via the matching DataMappingProfile into idempotent Session upserts keyed by externalRef, then triggers TimetableConflictDetector's batch scan (timetabling-and-substitution). 'lvs-results' (direction:import) hands a UWLR-carried Cito/IEP/Boom/Dia normed-result pull to the OpenConnector source configuration; the matching DataMappingProfile maps the incoming record onto LvsResult, which lands as 'imported' and awaits coordinator verification (lvs-import-contract). Learniq implements no Edukoppeling/StUF/OSO-XML/Digikoppeling/SAML/OOAPI/UWLR/Zermelo/Untis/Xedule wire code — all protocol logic lives in OpenConnector.": "Named OpenConnector connection (e.g. 'bron-rod', 'oso', 'leerplicht', 'surfconext', 'hr', 'swv', 'ooapi-catalog', 'timetable-import', 'lvs-results'). 'swv' routes a zorgvraag/TLV-chain dossier (learning-plan's SupportRequest) to the regional samenwerkingsverband (openconnector#753). 'ooapi-catalog' syncs a published/archived Course, Programme, or Cohort to the OOAPI 5.0 course catalog hosted by opencatalogi, per the course-management publication contract (course → course, program → program, offering → offering; see openspec/changes/delegate-ooapi-to-opencatalogi/design.md). 'timetable-import' (direction:import) hands a generated-timetable pull to the OpenConnector Zermelo/Untis/Xedule source configuration; TimetableImportHandler resolves the response via the matching DataMappingProfile into idempotent Session upserts keyed by externalRef, then triggers TimetableConflictDetector's batch scan (timetabling-and-substitution). 'lvs-results' (direction:import) hands a UWLR-carried Cito/IEP/Boom/Dia normed-result pull to the OpenConnector source configuration; the matching DataMappingProfile maps the incoming record onto LvsResult, which lands as 'imported' and awaits coordinator verification (lvs-import-contract). Learniq implements no Edukoppeling/StUF/OSO-XML/Digikoppeling/SAML/OOAPI/UWLR/Zermelo/Untis/Xedule wire code — all protocol logic lives in OpenConnector.",
        "Named OpenConnector connection: bron-rod | oso | leerplicht | surfconext | hr | swv | timetable-import | lvs-results | or a custom name. This is a reference to an OpenConnector source/target configuration — Learniq implements no wire protocol. 'timetable-import' (direction:import) resolves a Zermelo/Untis/Xedule-generated timetable into Session upserts, per timetabling-and-substitution. 'lvs-results' (direction:import) resolves a UWLR-carried Cito/IEP/Boom/Dia normed result into an LvsResult, per lvs-import-contract.": "Named OpenConnector connection: bron-rod | oso | leerplicht | surfconext | hr | swv | timetable-import | lvs-results | or a custom name. This is a reference to an OpenConnector source/target configuration — Learniq implements no wire protocol. 'timetable-import' (direction:import) resolves a Zermelo/Untis/Xedule-generated timetable into Session upserts, per timetabling-and-substitution. 'lvs-results' (direction:import) resolves a UWLR-carried Cito/IEP/Boom/Dia normed result into an LvsResult, per lvs-import-contract.",
